# CAP-G3 — Unused V2 grant residual-only honesty (path-A)

**Date:** 2026-08-12  
**Owner:** DE2 — Unused Grant Policy  
**Sprint:** CAP-G3 / SPRINT 4.3  
**Claim:** **FIXED residual-only** — not product HW/UI/Process sealed ops.

## Goal

Honest residual for V2 grants with **no sealed product ops**. Path-A: residual-only honesty. Do **not** invent CameraCap (or Audio/Usb/Hid/Window/Frame) product free names.

