| Cap | `is_cap_type` | `oo_cap_grant_*` | `oo_cap_require_*` | `sealed_kind_of` | Product lower |
|-----|---------------|------------------|--------------------|------------------|---------------|
| ProcessCap | yes | process | exact stub | none | no (`sys_exec` = SysCap / CAP-G4) |
| SyncCap | yes | sync | exact stub | none | no (mutex = ThreadCap) |
