**Out of unused-grant residual (product sealed elsewhere):** Fs/Net granular (G1/G2), Sys/Env/Time/Rand/Alloc/FFI/Thread/Gpu.

**Orthogonal residual:** AuditCap/HitlCap grant+require bodies still thin vs header/link checklist; HITL product is `verify_human` (Env+Fs). Emit type-driven main inject = **DE1**.

